<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was quiet late Tuesday. There were no sales of slaughter steers or heifers confirmed at the close.</p>
<p>Inquiry was moderate, demand was light. Sales confirmed on 9,200 head for the week to date, mostly previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>confirmed: none     last week:  66000     last year:  34300</p>
<p>week to date:  9200   last week:  83000   last year:  76000</p>
